{"id": "msg_2cea7bfa6c1b43f7b09546419c5daf0b", "role": "user", "parts": [{"type": "tool", "tool_id": "call_ca72e494799f4a5c94892ef3eabc8364|fc_0121fec1c666d37a016af8653db2e087d2a9a2d8cc405b8ed8", "tool_name": "skill", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "completed", "tool_output": "[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"<skill_content name=\\\"web-deploy\\\">\\n<skill_resources>\\nBase directory for this skill: C:\\\\Users\\\\Administrator\\\\.dsh\\\\skills\\\\web-deploy\\nResolve relative paths mentioned by this skill against the base directory before using them. Load referenced resources only as needed.\\n</skill_resources>\\n\\n<skill_instructions>\\n# 前端部署\\n\\n1. 不在本地启动前端开发服务器，包括 `npm run dev`、Vite、webpack serve、`next dev`。\\n2. 改完先构建，产出 `dist`。\\n3. 用本地 nginx UI 部署：已有站点就更新 root 到本项目 `dist`，没有就新增站点。\\n4. E2E 和联调访问 nginx 部署后的站点，不连 dev server。\\n5. 不用 `serve`、`live-server`、`http-server` 或 `python -m http.server` 替代 nginx UI。\\n</skill_instructions>\\n</skill_content>\"}]", "tool_output_group_id": "msg_2cea7bfa6c1b43f7b09546419c5daf0b", "tool_output_group_original_chars": 660, "tool_output_group_budget_chars": 100000}], "created_at": "2026-11-14T13:42:21.571Z", "peer_id": "gitlab.zhi.com-zhi-suzhou-shiqu-suzhufang-fe-zhi2-web-admin-h5-g-unlimited"}
